# Aether Spellbomb's bounce targets a creature (CR 115.1). Bot1 activates it on Bot2's Ornithopter, paying the
# sacrifice as a cost; Bot2 responds with Lightning Bolt on the Ornithopter. The target is gone when the ability
# resolves, so it has no legal target and does not resolve (CR 608.2b): the Ornithopter goes to the graveyard, not
# to the hand, and the Spellbomb stays sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Aether Spellbomb
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Aether Spellbomb.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Aether Spellbomb.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Return target creature)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Aether Spellbomb
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 5
Stack.Count = 0
